---
// About.astro - Keunggulan Platform & Curated Lists
const curatedLists = [
  {
    title: 'Neo-Noir & Urban Solitude',
    count: '6 Judul Pilihan',
    curator: 'Arisandi Wardhana',
    tags: ['Noir', 'Atmospheric', '80s-Modern'],
    description: 'Arsip film dengan pencahayaan neon temaram, karakter penyendiri, dan tensi psikologis kota malam.'
  },
  {
    title: 'Mind-Bending Sci-Fi Odyssey',
    count: '8 Judul Pilihan',
    curator: 'Bagas Perkasa',
    tags: ['Sci-Fi', 'Kosmik', 'Filosofis'],
    description: 'Eksplorasi ruang waktu, kecerdasan artifisial, dan batas kesadaran manusia melintasi tata surya.'
  },
  {
    title: 'Asian Arthouse Essentials',
    count: '7 Judul Pilihan',
    curator: 'Maya Lestari',
    tags: ['Drama', 'Realisme', 'Festival'],
    description: 'Sinema kontemporer Asia dengan kedalaman narasi domestik, puitika visual, dan kritik sosial tajam.'
  }
];
---

<section id="lists" class="relative py-20 border-t border-[#263042]/60 bg-[#090A0F]" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-16">
    
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="max-w-2xl text-left space-y-3">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-amber-500/20 bg-[#161B26] px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-amber-400">
        Keunggulan Platform
      </div>
      <h2 id="about-heading" class="font-['Cinzel'] text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#F3F4F6] sm:text-4xl">
        Didesain untuk Penikmat Sinema Sejati
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base text-[#9CA3AF]">
        CineVault menyederhanakan pengalaman mencatat tontonan dan mempertemukan Anda dengan kurator independen dalam antarmuka yang bebas distraksi iklan.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 3-Column Core Value Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      
      <!-- Feature 1: Aesthetic Watch Log -->
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#263042] bg-[#161B26] p-7 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-amber-500/40 hover:-translate-y-1">
        <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-amber-500/10 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-400 mb-6">
          <!-- Film Reel & Pen Icon -->
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M11 5H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v11a2 2 0 002 2h11a2 2 0 002-2v-5m-1.414-9.414a2 2 0 112.828 2.828L11.828 15H9v-2.828l8.586-8.586z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-['Outfit'] text-xl font-bold text-[#F3F4F6] mb-3">
          Aesthetic Watch Log
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#9CA3AF] leading-relaxed">
          Catat tanggal menonton, berikan rating bintang, dan tulis ulasan singkat secara instan tanpa gangguan iklan komersial yang mengalihkan perhatian.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 2: Curated Lists -->
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#263042] bg-[#161B26] p-7 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-amber-500/40 hover:-translate-y-1">
        <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-rose-500/10 border border-rose-500/30 text-rose-400 mb-6">
          <!-- Library / Curated Folder Icon -->
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 11H5m14 0a2 2 0 012 2v6a2 2 0 01-2 2H5a2 2 0 01-2-2v-6a2 2 0 012-2m14 0V9a2 2 0 00-2-2M5 11V9a2 2 0 012-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h6a2 2 0 012 2v2M7 7h10" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-['Outfit'] text-xl font-bold text-[#F3F4F6] mb-3">
          Curated Lists
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#9CA3AF] leading-relaxed">
          Buat dan bagikan daftar tontonan tematik seperti "Sci-Fi Masterpieces 2010an" ke publik dengan tampilan poster yang memikat mata.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 3: Direct Insights -->
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#263042] bg-[#161B26] p-7 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-amber-500/40 hover:-translate-y-1">
        <div class="flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 border border-emerald-500/30 text-emerald-400 mb-6">
          <!-- Chat / Direct Connection Icon -->
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01M21 12c0 4.418-4.03 8-9 8a9.863 9.863 0 01-4.255-.949L3 20l1.395-3.72C3.512 15.042 3 13.574 3 12c0-4.418 4.03-8 9-8s9 3.582 9 8z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-['Outfit'] text-xl font-bold text-[#F3F4F6] mb-3">
          Direct Insights via WhatsApp
        </h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#9CA3AF] leading-relaxed">
          Hubungkan pencinta film secara langsung dengan kurator dan sesama kreator untuk diskusi mendalam tanpa perantara algoritma tertutup.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Curated Lists Showcase Subsection -->
    <div class="rounded-2xl border border-[#263042] bg-[#161B26]/60 p-6 sm:p-8 space-y-6">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-['Outfit'] text-2xl font-bold text-[#F3F4F6]">
            Daftar Kurasi Tematik Komunitas
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#9CA3AF] mt-1">
            Pilihan film terstruktur yang disusun oleh kurator independen CineVault.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a
          href="#catalog"
          class="inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center text-sm font-semibold text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 transition-colors focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-amber-400 rounded px-2"
        >
          <span>Eksplorasi Semua Film di Katalog &rarr;</span>
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 pt-2">
        {curatedLists.map((list) => (
          <div class="rounded-xl border border-[#263042] bg-[#090A0F] p-5 flex flex-col justify-between space-y-4 hover:border-amber-500/30 transition-all">
            <div class="space-y-3">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
                <span class="rounded bg-amber-500/10 px-2 py-0.5 font-medium text-amber-400 border border-amber-500/20">
                  {list.count}
                </span>
                <span class="text-[#9CA3AF]">Oleh {list.curator}</span>
              </div>
              <h4 class="font-['Outfit'] text-lg font-bold text-[#F3F4F6]">
                {list.title}
              </h4>
              <p class="text-xs text-[#9CA3AF] leading-relaxed">
                {list.description}
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 pt-2 border-t border-[#263042]/50">
              {list.tags.map((tag) => (
                <span class="rounded bg-[#161B26] px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] text-[#9CA3AF]">
                  #{tag}
                </span>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
